                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "124e441a-1d76-41ec-b008-f968e16e0469",
                        "source_entry_id": "82823a98-e4ef-3be4-b096-0adb3ca6f294",
                        "source_sense_id": "d63346f4-2553-3a1d-bfa7-4ae4e6c172f3",
                        "source_sense_description": "ein einzelner Strahl der Sonne",
                        "target_lang_word": "sunbeam",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sunbeam",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a056f411-4723-3d89-8f57-afea1aa23b81",
                                        "entry_id": "9cc0db1a-7c08-3b82-85cc-cf837b8331ef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A visible, narrow, and intense (relative to ambient light) ray of sunlight."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ca9e42f-6f23-404d-80ef-8f1456f5fca6",
                                                "sense_id": "a056f411-4723-3d89-8f57-afea1aa23b81",
                                                "text": "I cut-in various other material to this; for instance, a shot of a rushing brook in springtime, with dancing sunbeams reflected in the water; of birds splashing in the village pond; and, finally, of a laughing child."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7563ef27-0822-4306-bfff-e5a2f6807b8a",
                                                "sense_id": "a056f411-4723-3d89-8f57-afea1aa23b81",
                                                "text": "Similarly, the rays diverging from the sun will pass by you and converge on the point directly opposite the sun, the shadow of your head. All sunbeams, and thus all shadows, appear to converge there.[…]Only perspective makes all shadows appear to converge on the antisolar point. But this point is also the center of the rainbow, so as you look at the rainbow, all sunbeams and shadows will lie along radii of the bow as they flow straight to its center."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b5c6f95-93f2-434a-8e9e-ae71ad3c395b",
                                                "sense_id": "a056f411-4723-3d89-8f57-afea1aa23b81",
                                                "text": "I had frequently had to explain to cameramen that only in the early morning or late in the evening did sunbeams fall from the window as flat as they were usually found in films. The sun being higher during the hours of work, another way of showing sunbeams had to be found."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1267fe47-8499-32f5-b16f-c6855fc7fb50",
                                        "entry_id": "9cc0db1a-7c08-3b82-85cc-cf837b8331ef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An item of cutlery or crockery laid out on a table, but not used, and which can be returned to the drawer without being washed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Australia",
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1ea4f4ff-2aa6-33c4-879b-1f5dcc857086",
                                        "entry_id": "9cc0db1a-7c08-3b82-85cc-cf837b8331ef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of various lycaenid butterflies of the genus Curetis."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fe5b4399-855d-3fac-88c9-b9cd1a2c81fd",
                                        "entry_id": "9cc0db1a-7c08-3b82-85cc-cf837b8331ef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any hummingbird of the genus Aglaeactis."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e61ddf0a-e1f6-31c9-a00f-976f1a916c15",
                                        "entry_id": "9cc0db1a-7c08-3b82-85cc-cf837b8331ef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Synonym of sunshine (“ironic form of address to an inferior or troublemaker”)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "UK"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c967f27-f91e-4198-adc8-f5b6e1fed58c",
                                                "sense_id": "e61ddf0a-e1f6-31c9-a00f-976f1a916c15",
                                                "text": "DOCTOR: You seem to be our best bet so far, don't you think so, Mel? Mel? Where's Mel?\nDEPUTY: No, no, no, sunbeam. You're coming with us."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c28e27ce-74a2-4aec-8fbe-5ec953d090b7",
                        "source_entry_id": "82823a98-e4ef-3be4-b096-0adb3ca6f294",
                        "source_sense_id": "d63346f4-2553-3a1d-bfa7-4ae4e6c172f3",
                        "source_sense_description": "ein einzelner Strahl der Sonne",
                        "target_lang_word": "rayon de soleil",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "rayon de soleil",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b571121e-ca67-33cc-abd4-1adcff5e6293",
                                        "entry_id": "35af8aef-63c5-34e8-af40-ee7c3a16e1c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Rai de lumière émis par le soleil."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4820427-eb08-4d0f-9cb0-1c3220c65a2c",
                                                "sense_id": "b571121e-ca67-33cc-abd4-1adcff5e6293",
                                                "text": "Quand un rayon de soleil est réfracté par un prisme immobile, les rayons incidents et réfractés font entre eux un angle qui dépend de la substance, de l’angle du prisme, et aussi de celui sous lequel le rayon est incident; si l'angle d’incidence varie, celui du rayon réfracté varie avec lui."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a9d3572-d6d7-402c-90af-cd963e9378ff",
                                                "sense_id": "b571121e-ca67-33cc-abd4-1adcff5e6293",
                                                "text": "Un rayon de soleil, qui passait à travers la feuillée des tilleuls, jouait sur sa chevelure et en faisait une auréole d'or."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "83ad4aa3-bbdc-3a72-adb8-967b475c0336",
                                        "entry_id": "35af8aef-63c5-34e8-af40-ee7c3a16e1c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Chose qui apporte du bien-être."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aad08954-3ecb-49ab-902f-0642fb351b94",
                                                "sense_id": "83ad4aa3-bbdc-3a72-adb8-967b475c0336",
                                                "text": "« Mon cher grand, reçois les tendres baisers de ta mère qui ne t’a jamais oublié et à laquelle ta présence a mis un rayon de soleil dans le cœur. » Elle doit lire de bien mauvais livres, me disais-je en relisant cette dernière phrase."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77dc6eee-1c6a-4b82-b793-e5f2b23a83e2",
                                                "sense_id": "83ad4aa3-bbdc-3a72-adb8-967b475c0336",
                                                "text": "Les animaux nous donnent tellement d’amour. Ils sont une source de réconfort quand on rentre chez soi. Ils sont mes rayons de soleil. Ma thérapie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a5c887d-d56d-4784-a2c5-4831ab0c50c0",
                                                "sense_id": "83ad4aa3-bbdc-3a72-adb8-967b475c0336",
                                                "text": "Ne négligeons pas les relations « sans importance » qui n’en ont que le nom : les voisins, les commerçants peuvent se révéler de vrais rayons de soleil dans une journée."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
